Z||000000||dreams||04-23-2001||10:38 PM||||Im new to this fiero stuff. I need help with my ac. I cant get it to cycle. any hints? It has been recharged and it still wont cycle.||||reg||8
Z||000001||Carrolles||04-24-2001||08:11 AM||||Which year model and engine?<P>I believe there is an A/C relay on the rear firewall just behind the rear glass.  Check to see that it is getting power.  Check the pressure switch on the dryer to see if it is working.<P>On the obvious side, have you checked all the fuses?  Do you have any of the service manuals like Haynes, Chiltons, Helms?  Even the Haynes is helpful to have.||||reg||1
Z||000002||TheFiero64||04-25-2001||04:49 PM||||Try checking the pressure switch up front. It is on the Receiver/drier. Unplug it and ground the 2 connections together to see if your clutch cycles.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
